{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bread","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/620dfda98f388846aabc4cae822cc2f6f92f40a6.jpg"},{"name":"Videotape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/385e2c2cef339389903eacfcb314b8d6e310e139.jpg"},{"name":"Radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/4a18f5751e5a62515e76c114c9abb8104e3d3909.jpg"},{"name":"Test of Courage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/a9c0800816b0ab5e742db51dcb5a24a6205edb7f.jpg"},{"name":"Apple Pie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/e2697be0a0f64d69db57a4a119fe755954344ee8.jpg"},{"name":"Balloon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4051210/7d319b2c5caaa17527ee21d72e3e738fd4db9659.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051210?t=1761829209","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051210?t=1761829209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051210/b72d588eb96c992ea323d5a9db3d3540b3b3a046/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761829209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051210/b72d588eb96c992ea323d5a9db3d3540b3b3a046/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761829209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>","developers":["Gattorocco"],"genres":[{"descri